==============================================================================
THE REFUSALS. A gate that reports on a fixture which cannot show the thing it
exists for is worse than no gate: it is a green badge over no evidence. Each
refusal exits 2, which is make's number for a failed recipe as well - measured,
not assumed, in Phase 24 and again here.
==============================================================================
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[5] REFUSAL - the run layer taken away
    tests/fixtures/page-inflight/layer moved aside. THIS IS THE STATE BOTH
    page-measure SETS ARE PERMANENTLY IN: those ten documents 404 against the
    static server there and measure-page.mjs prints a figure without a word,
    because its own refusal only watches requests that LEAVE the origin
    changed: 10 files changed, 562 deletions(-)
    $ make page-inflight-check
    page-inflight: the page asked this gate's own server for documents it does not have, and a page missing its run layer renders quietly and prints no figures at all - which is the state every one of these claims would then be measured in:
      /timeline/stage/nodes-apply.json
      /timeline/stage/nodes-destroy.json
      /timeline/stage/latest.json
      /results/stage/latest.json
      /cost/stage/latest.json
      /timeline/prod/nodes-apply.json
      /timeline/prod/nodes-destroy.json
      /timeline/prod/latest.json
      /results/prod/latest.json
      /cost/prod/latest.json
    exit=2
    tree restored, clean
